member blobs match GitHub and the in-repo own gate passes. Read-only preflight for the one fresh pair passed on actual optional Python 3.11.17/NumPy 2.4.6/Numba 0.68.1/OpenSpiel 2.0.2 with the full pinned Apache-2.0 license, no reference construction and clean pushed head `bac111d`. One fixed complete ordinary→validated-share pair then passed at clean `bac111d`: ordinary 531.45s, shared 542.31s, outer 1,076.04/1,800s; each child had two archive roots, 14 original loads, three reads, 432 profiles, 1,152 conditions and three workers; shared had 12 substitutions. Exact scientific result, work counters, context and predecessor identity matched. No reference output entered training. The [32-member compressed raw record](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/297c4f59ec5a7bbb52571e8920ba9593e363e2b2/results/validated-sharing-count-gate/pair-raw/manifest.json) was published at `297c4f5` before report work; all three GitHub archive blobs match local bytes and its data-only verifier passes. The initial verifier had a wrong ordinary-row schema assumption; it was corrected without changing captured bytes. The [data-only report and JSON](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/9f40bd40f559a28a7195411948735bb9b330c934/docs/validated-sharing-count-gate-result.md) were published at `9f40bd4` after the raw archive. Ten focused tamper/import tests pass; both locked runtimes render identical JSON SHA-256 `b7eda7fc00ecef6e3176da8c0d2c9bf7589ad1897332bf5a4284a936fe82819d`. Exact report-head local checks pass: both clean bases 5,639 passed/72 skipped/150 deselected; optional Python 3.11 2,545 passed; optional Python 3.12 2,544 passed/one expected skip (73 fixed suites each); Ruff, format, strict mypy on 850 files, all-files hooks and clean pre/post guards. Hosted report-head CI and final evidence receipt remain pending. Because every original loader still runs, no CPU saving or stronger strategy is established.\n\nPR #93's failed and ineligible pair remains historical; no retry, 